Package: innovate.R
Title: R Bindings Over the Functional Kernel
Version: 0.7.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dylan", "Mordaunt", email = "dylan.mordaunt@vuw.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Thin native bindings to the Rust-owned Innovate scientific kernel.
    Shared versioned requests expose fitting, prediction and diagnostics without
    a Python interpreter. Unported capabilities return structured native errors.
